        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UsadaMAZE&quot;</strong> is an adventure game with puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/f98327c972bffc38a64fd04fbe9ea6a9.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come to your senses, realizing you’ve been abducted and wake up in a mysterious room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of you stands <i>a small creature that looks like a rabbit—but isn’t.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I’m Usada, the homeroom teacher in charge of this class.”<br>“You will now take part in my lessons and follow my instructions.”<br>“Ah, don’t run. Don’t move… a metal block is about to fall from above.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Oh dear, we’ve lost another student.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through mazes, dash across illegal structures, and press mysterious buttons.<br>The lesson under Teacher Usada begins—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/a4bc091c44b2aa98384c470857b3400b.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that look complicated… but are far too simple.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events occur as you move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits—enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy this “Kingdom.”</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30–90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/a08aac34ac99a9a3936e0e2d3ca2d245.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed <strong>for both individuals and organizations</strong> without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UsadaMAZE&quot;</strong> is an adventure game with puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/f98327c972bffc38a64fd04fbe9ea6a9.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You come to your senses, realizing you’ve been abducted and wake up in a mysterious room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of you stands <i>a small creature that looks like a rabbit—but isn’t.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“I’m Usada, the homeroom teacher in charge of this class.”<br>“You will now take part in my lessons and follow my instructions.”<br>“Ah, don’t run. Don’t move… a metal block is about to fall from above.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Oh dear, we’ve lost another student.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through mazes, dash across illegal structures, and press mysterious buttons.<br>The lesson under Teacher Usada begins—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/a4bc091c44b2aa98384c470857b3400b.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles that look complicated… but are far too simple.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events occur as you move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress the story by examining objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits—enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy this “Kingdom.”</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 30–90 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174530/extras/a08aac34ac99a9a3936e0e2d3ca2d245.avif?t=1768175620\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed <strong>for both individuals and organizations</strong> without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
